WEBVTT

00:04:26.512 --> 00:04:32.643
PM: And that was the criteria
on which you selected the candidates.

00:04:32.685 --> 00:04:36.981
I've also noticed some of them,
maybe most of them are women.

00:04:37.023 --> 00:04:40.735
Seeing women taking
those front line positions.

00:04:41.027 --> 00:04:42.361
JF: Women of color.

00:04:44.113 --> 00:04:47.867
Very often they're the first --
the first woman, the first Latina,

00:04:47.908 --> 00:04:49.952
the first person under 30,

00:04:49.994 --> 00:04:52.079
they’re really breaking
a lot of boundaries,

00:04:52.079 --> 00:04:53.706
and they're so brave.

00:04:54.123 --> 00:04:55.333
I was just in Texas,

00:04:55.374 --> 00:04:58.586
and it's filled me with hope
that will last me for years.